<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway 2000 stays buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway 2000 stays buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura said analyst Dan Ries reiterated Gateway 2000 Inc as buy.</p>
<p>-- raised earnings estimate to $3.04 from $2.96 for 1996, and to $3.82 from $3.77 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- company reported earnings of $0.78 per share for the third quarter, above the Street estimate of $0.73, but &quot;likely in line with 'whisper' estimates,&quot;  Ries said.</p>
<p>-- raised 12-month price target to $62 from $58. Shares fell 3-3/4 to 51-3/8.</p>
</text>
